{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOfqivgTxYXpFsCgedym","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to work through my design and build reasoning myself, and the substantive thread here is about what the next build step needs. Let me lay out the problem as I see it and work it through.\n\nThe bug I just hit is that `combineAsVariants` misbehaves when the components have child widths that differ, and calling `createInstance` on components already nested inside variants can break nodes on combine. My `tabBar` function also creates a fresh component on every call — 4 per bar, 12 extra components total, all named identically (\"State=Active, Icon=Home\" etc.). That gives 12 extra components that never join a set. They are instances of those components, so the visual chain is fine, but the bloat is real, and duplicate names are messy.\n\nThe way I fix it: delete the tab set at 9:32 and every component whose name matches the tab-bar or tab-icon naming, then rebuild one \"Tab Item\" variant set with 8 variants — Icon=Home/Explore/Analytics/Profile crossed with State=Active/Inactive — and one Tab Bar component with 3 variants (Active=Home/Explore/Analytics) holding 4 instances each. That resolves the width mismatch because each variant is built to the same dimensions before combining.\n\nI also want the remaining business components. Section Header with title plus optional \"See more\" chevron. Workout Card at 188x196: white card, radius 20, clipsContent, 188x140 photo, 40 lime play circle with charcoal Icon_Play, chips with Icon_Fire \"500 Kcal\" and Icon_Timer \"50 Min\", name at 14 Bold, chips at 11 Medium. Plan Row at 350x82: 58 photo at x=12, name at 84/16, caption at 84/34, 150x6 lime progress track at 84/56 with a % label. Round Row at 350x64: index \"01\", 44 photo radius 12, duration with a 14 Icon_Timer, 32 lime play circle right. Day Cell at 38x54 with Default and Current variants. Program Tile at 160x186. Challenge Chip at 140x88 on charcoal with a lime arrow. Analytics tiles: Active calories 645 Cal with a 24 num, Training time 80% with a ring using strokeDashes, Heart Rate 79 Bpm with a sparkline, Steps 999/2000 with a progress bar, Water 6/8 Cups with 8 droplet dots, Sleep with 5 bars, Cycling 350x132 over a map with a lime circle around Icon_Cycling. A Search Field that instances 1:31 with Icon_Search inside the input.\n\nOn positioning: setting x on an auto-layout child is ignored, so the button centering by `(w-350)/2` is harmless — FIXED primary axis with CENTER alignment already does the work. The tabItem pill with layoutMode NONE lets me set icon.x=12 and icon.y=4 directly, which is what I want there.\n\nFor text overrides, the safe route is findChild by name ('Title','Meta','Name','Pct','Label','Value') on each instance, then set characters, and set fills on image-holding children. Gradients on the workout photo: GRADIENT_LINEAR with stops from transparent to black at 0.45 alpha.\n\nI run the components as one call at a second library frame around y=2900, then screens 01–03, then 04–05 with the prototype.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":13702,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":35273,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13702}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"67c1e381-6134-4a18-bec5-174f3a1e408c","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:14:38.360Z","thinking_duration_ms":70654}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOfqivgTxYXpFsCgedym","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list for the next step: rebuild the tab system cleanly (the previous pass left duplicate sub-components), define the remaining business components (cards, rows, chips, tiles, headers), and keep positions non-overlapping. Those all depend only on node IDs I already have, so I'll batch the tab rebuild and the business-component build into a single write, then screens next."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":13702,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":35273,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13702}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"336e05f4-9606-4132-84f0-872578b6b4bf","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:14:40.590Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOfqivgTxYXpFsCgedym","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01cZNUECBxXpJl8lHHIPTCX4","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf('03')===0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst H=h=>{h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};};\nconst C={lime:'#BBF246',char:'#192126',ink2:'#5B6B72',muted:'#8B979D',line:'#E9EDEF',bg:'#F5F7F8',surf:'#FFFFFF',dark2:'#2A383F',track:'#E6EAEC',white:'#FFFFFF'};\nconst F={Regular:{family:'Lato',style:'Regular'},Bold:{family:'Lato',style:'Bold'},Black:{family:'Lato',style:'Black'},Medium:{family:'Lato',style:'Medium'}};\nconst stylesRes = await figma.getLocalTextStylesAsync();\nconst ST=n=>stylesRes.find(s=>s.name===n);\n\n// --- remove old tab components ---\nconst kill=[];\nfor(const n of page.findAll(x=>x.type==='COMPONENT'||x.type==='COMPONENT_SET')){\n  if(/^Tab Bar \\//.test(n.name)||/^Tab Item$/.test(n.name)||/^State=(Active|Inactive), Icon=/.test(n.name)) kill.push(n);\n}\nkill.forEach(n=>{try{n.remove()}catch(e){}});\n\nfunction txt(str,styleName,color,opts){\n  const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName=F.Regular;\n  const st=ST(styleName); if(st) t.textStyleId=st.id;\n  t.characters=str;\n  if(opts&&opts.size) t.fontSize=opts.size;\n  if(opts&&opts.bold) t.fontName=F.Bold;\n  if(opts&&opts.black) t.fontName=F.Black;\n  if(opts&&opts.medium) t.fontName=F.Medium;\n  t.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:H(color)}];\n  if(opts&&opts.width){ t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(opts.width,t.height); }\n  return t;\n}\nfunction icon(id,color,size){ const i=figma.getNodeById(id).createInstance(); i.resize(size,size);\n  i.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>{ if(v.strokes&&v.strokes.length) v.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:H(color)}]; }); return i; }\nfunction photo(hash,w,h,radius){ const r=figma.createRectangle(); r.name='Photo'; r.resize(w,h); if(radius) r.cornerRadius=radius;\n  r.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',scaleMode:'FILL',imageHash:hash}]; return r; }\nfunction rect(name,w,h,fill,radius){ const r=figma.createRectangle(); r.name=name; r.resize(w,h); r.cornerRadius=radius||0;\n  if(fill) r.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:H(fill)}]; else r.fills=[]; return r; }\nfunction ell(name,d,fill){ const e=figma.createEllipse(); e.name=name; e.resize(d,d); e.fills=fill?[{type:'SOLID',color:H(fill)}]:[]; return e; }\nconst SH=(a,y)=>[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.098,g:0.129,b:0.149,a:a},offset:{x:0,y:y===undefined?8:y},radius:22,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n\nconst ICON={home:'5:25',explore:'5:22',analytics:'5:21',profile:'5:27',play:'5:26',back:'5:23',fire:'5:20',timer:'5:31',\n  search:'5:28',chev:'5:19',heart:'5:24',steps:'5:30',water:'5:32',sleep:'5:29',cycling:'5:18'};\nconst IMG={onboard:'44ddcf352d6de351b71d06a506e967fe6d03c13c',lower:'1303318356825b2c1d3108b2b8bb53adc6a4c9b7',\n  hand:'c690d5156c51db879ce334cbfa70c2729042956b',push:'e4d40d4f54597e68ae7ffc61bb102f7cdc5e97ea',\n  sit:'fac887b624f0a807598229986e617c2de4803452',knee:'fb77c66132917b854367423c52c22b13df39e2fd',\n  belly:'729ae8502ec31636250dc567ab7b3f1c9738d8c4',losefat:'fe26967f3de7b5e4b130e59faef747e9452b2a1f',\n  plank:'e253947388338f0b0fd63a08ec9df0eba9c11eee',biceps:'6c0a3f8f56d60130bcace853c8d14de9ea8000ad',\n  leg:'1513f5d7086ed9d38c1db245cf1cfa3441ddb093',backlunge:'f3c2b3c833d85a979d84e29240d775aaf3340834',\n  quarantine:'7539acdeb30312c7bde52bd81df9d75417521c4f',jacks:'0e6eb7eb4debf109865ea677116bb2e31153a74c',\n  squats:'6b3c80354a3fbe4f8d862855c80693ad74dea497',map:'2d88dba0c75b137d509f091e4496e9031b9da2a6'};\n\nconst libName='04 Components · Business';\nlet lib2 = page.children.find(n=>n.name===libName);\nif(!lib2){ lib2=figma.createFrame(); lib2.name=libName; lib2.resize(1720,1400); lib2.fills=[]; lib2.x=0; lib2.y=2900; page.appendChild(lib2); }\nconst lib1 = page.children.find(n=>n.name==='03 Components · Fitness');\nfunction place(c,x,y){ lib2.appendChild(c); c.x=x; c.y=y; }\nfunction mkC(name,w,h,fill,radius){ const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name=name; c.resize(w,h); c.cornerRadius=radius||0;\n  c.fills=fill?[{type:'SOLID',color:H(fill)}]:[]; c.clipsContent=false; return c; }\n\n// ================= TAB SYSTEM =================\nfunction tabItem(name,id,state){\n  const c=mkC('State='+state+', Icon='+name,87.5,58,null,0);\n  c.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n  c.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; c.itemSpacing=5;\n  const on = state==='Active';\n  const pill=figma.createFrame(); pill.name='Pill'; pill.resize(46,30); pill.cornerRadius=15;\n  pill.fills = on?[{type:'SOLID',color:H(C.lime)}]:[];\n  pill.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; pill.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; pill.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  pill.appendChild(icon(id, on?C.char:C.muted, 20));\n  c.appendChild(pill);\n  const lb=txt(name, on?'Label / 11 Bold':'Label / 11 Bold', on?C.char:C.muted,{size:10,bold:true});\n  c.appendChild(lb);\n  return c;\n}\nconst tabs=[];\n[['Home',ICON.home],['Explore',ICON.explore],['Analytics',ICON.analytics],['Profile',ICON.profile]].forEach(([n,id])=>{\n  tabs.push(tabItem(n,id,'Active')); tabs.push(tabItem(n,id,'Inactive'));\n});\nconst tabSet=figma.combineAsVariants(tabs,lib1); tabSet.name='Tab Item'; tabSet.x=0; tabSet.y=0;\nconst tabVariant=(iconName,state)=>tabSet.children.find(x=>x.name.includes('Icon='+iconName)&&x.name.includes('State='+state));\n\nconst tabBarVariants=[];\n['Home','Explore','Analytics'].forEach(active=>{\n  const c=mkC('Active Tab='+active,390,78,C.white,0);\n  c.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.098,g:0.129,b:0.149,a:0.10},offset:{x:0,y:-6},radius:20,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n  const line=rect('Divider',390,1,C.line,0); c.appendChild(line); line.x=0; line.y=0;\n  ['Home','Explore','Analytics','Profile'].forEach((n,i)=>{\n    const inst=tabVariant(n, n===active?'Active':'Inactive').createInstance();\n    c.appendChild(inst); inst.x=12+i*91.5; inst.y=12;\n    inst.findAll(x=>x.type==='TEXT').forEach(t=>{ if(t.characters!==n) t.characters=n; });\n  });\n  tabBarVariants.push(c);\n});\nconst tabBarSet=figma.combineAsVariants(tabBarVariants,lib1); tabBarSet.name='Tab Bar'; tabBarSet.x=0; tabBarSet.y=130;\n\n// ================= SMALL COMPONENTS =================\nfunction sectionHead(hasAction){\n  const c=mkC('Action='+(hasAction?'Yes':'No'),350,28,null,0);\n  c.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n  c.primaryAxisAlignItems='SPACE_BETWEEN'; c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  const t=txt('Section', 'H2 / 20 Black',C.char,{black:true}); t.name='Title'; c.appendChild(t);\n  if(hasAction){\n    const g=c.appendChild(figma.createFrame()); g.name='Action'; g.resize(88,24); g.fills=[]; g.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL';\n    g.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; g.itemSpacing=4; g.primaryAxisAlignItems='MAX';\n    const s=txt('See all','Caption / 12 Regular',C.ink2,{size:12}); s.name='ActionLabel'; g.appendChild(s);\n    g.appendChild(icon(ICON.chev,C.ink2,16));\n  }\n  return c;\n}\nconst sh=figma.combineAsVariants([sectionHead(false),sectionHead(true)],lib2); sh.name='Section Header'; place(sh,0,900); sh.x=0; sh.y=900;\n\n// Search field reusing the given Text Field\nconst givenField = figma.getNodeById('1:31');\nfunction searchField(state){\n  const c=mkC('State='+state,350,48,C.white,14);\n  c.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:H(state==='Focused'?C.char:C.line)}];\n  c.strokeWeight=state==='Focused'?1.5:1;\n  if(state==='Focused') c.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.733,g:0.949,b:0.275,a:0.35},offset:{x:0,y:0},radius:0,spread:3,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\n  const g=figma.createFrame(); g.name='Row'; g.resize(350,48); g.fills=[]; g.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL';\n  g.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; g.primaryAxisAlignItems='MIN'; g.itemSpacing=10; g.paddingLeft=16; g.paddingRight=16;\n  c.appendChild(g); g.x=0; g.y=0;\n  g.appendChild(icon(ICON.search, state==='Disabled'?C.muted:C.char, 20));\n  const t=txt(state==='Filled'?'Lower body':'Search', 'Body / 14 Regular', state==='Filled'?C.char:C.muted,{size:14});\n  t.name='Placeholder'; g.appendChild(t);\n  if(state==='Filled'){ const x=rect('Clear',20,20,'#EDF0F2',10); g.appendChild(x); }\n  return c;\n}\nconst sf=figma.combineAsVariants([searchField('Default'),searchField('Focused'),searchField('Filled')],lib2);\nsf.name='Search Field'; place(sf,380,900); sf.x=380; sf.y=900;\n\n// Back button\nconst bb=mkC('Back Button',44,44,C.white,22); bb.effects=SH(0.08);\nconst bi=icon(ICON.back,C.char,22); bb.appendChild(bi); bi.x=11; bi.y=11;\n\n// ================= WORKOUT CARD =================\nfunction workoutCard(name,hash,kcal,min){\n  const c=mkC('Workout Card',188,208,C.white,22);\n  c.clipsContent=true; c.effects=SH(0.09,10);\n  const ph=photo(hash,188,132,0); c.appendChild(ph); ph.x=0; ph.y=0;\n  const grad=rect('Scrim',188,132,null,0);\n  grad.fills=[{type:'GRADIENT_LINEAR',gradientTransform:[[1,0,0],[0,1,0]],gradientStops:[\n    {position:0,color:{r:0.098,g:0.129,b:0.149,a:0}},{position:1,color:{r:0.098,g:0.129,b:0.149,a:0.55}}]}];\n  c.appendChild(grad); grad.x=0; grad.y=0;\n  const play=ell('Play',38,C.lime); c.appendChild(play); play.x=136; play.y=80;\n  const pi=icon(ICON.play,C.char,16); play.appendChild(pi); pi.x=11; pi.y=11;\n  const nm=txt(name,'Body / 14 Bold',C.char,{bold:true,width:156}); nm.name='Name'; c.appendChild(nm); nm.x=14; nm.y=144;\n  const row=figma.createFrame(); row.name='Meta'; row.resize(160,20); row.fills=[]; c.appendChild(row); row.x=14; row.y=180;\n  row.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; row.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; row.itemSpacing=5;\n  row.appendChild(icon(ICON.fire,C.ink2,14));\n  const k=txt(kcal,'Caption / 12 Regular',C.ink2,{size:12}); k.name='Kcal'; row.appendChild(k);\n  const d=rect(