{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOgBCW60hvkvx9n2CbxU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me fix the workout card bug: `play.appendChild(pi)` fails because `play` is an ELLIPSE. I append icons to the parent component and position them absolutely at play.x+11, play.y+11. Component frames default to layoutMode NONE, so this works. I then wipe lib2 and rebuild it fully with this fix.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":13892,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":65273,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13892}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"b80a4925-3d8d-41c1-8915-1361832d7bbc","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:17:42.290Z","thinking_duration_ms":5654}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOgBCW60hvkvx9n2CbxU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The error is a real API constraint: an ellipse cannot host child nodes, so the play icons must be appended to the card and positioned over the circle. I'll wipe the partial business library and rebuild it with that fix — no dependency on any other result, so one call."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":13892,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":65273,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13892}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"95670497-7613-43a4-9387-7122a000b4bb","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:17:43.653Z"}
