{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOgVB5hjtaMod1uSzdgc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to privately list what I need next, then request every item that doesn't depend on another's result in this one response, so I batch the independent calls. The five frames all depend only on component IDs I already have, so they can be built in batches. Screens 01, 02, 03 go at x = 0, 440, 880, and screens 04, 05 go at x = 1320, 1760; the two batches do not depend on each other and use distinct x ranges, so they are safe to issue together.\n\nFor 01_Onboarding: frame 390x844, fill charcoal #192126, a 390x600 photo with a gradient scrim to charcoal, a white sheet with 32 rounded top corners from y=524 to 844, the headline \"Wherever you are, health is number one\" at 30/34 Black, the sub \"There is no instant way to a healthy life\" at 14 regular muted, and a 350x56 lime button \"Get Started\" at y=716. The status bar instance gets white glyphs on this dark frame, and the home indicator stays charcoal on the white sheet.\n\nFor 02_Home: light #F5F7F8, greeting at 20,60, name \"Pramuditya Uzumaki\" at 26 Black, 44 avatar circle at x=326, search field instance 350x48 at y=110, \"Popular Workouts\" header at 174, two 188-wide workout cards at y=208 (x=20 and 222) ending at 416, \"Today Plan\" header at 436, three 84-tall plan rows at y=470, 562, 654 ending at 738, and the tab bar at y=766.\n\nFor 03_Explore: title at 20,56, a 350x132 banner at y=96 ending at 228, \"Best for you\" header at 240, a 2x2 grid of 160-wide program tiles at x=20 and x=210, rows at y=272 and y=456, each tile 160x172 with a 160x92 photo, name, minutes, and level, ending at 628, \"Challenge\" header at 642, challenge cards at y=670 with height 76 ending at 746, and the tab bar at y=766. A tighter variant puts the banner at 96-206, the grid at 244-386 and 392-534, the challenge chips at 570-634, and two 56-tall Fast Warmup rows at 648-704 and 710-766, so every required element stays visible above the tab bar.\n\nFor 04_Workout: charcoal, 390x300 photo header, back button at y=64, \"Workout\" label centered, \"Lower Body Training\" at 34 Black on the photo at y=214, two stat chips (Time 50 min, Burn 500 kcal) at y=312, description at 14 regular #B7C2C7 width 350 at y=386, a \"Rounds\" header with a \"1/3\" pill at y=482, three 350x68 round rows at y=518, 592, 666, a 350x56 lime \"Let's Workout\" button at y=748 ending at 804, and the status bar in white.\n\nFor 05_Analytics: light, \"Analytics\" title at 56, a 350x112 calendar card at 94 with \"July 2022\" and 8 day cells 40 wide at x = 8 + i*42, y=46, with T12 current and ending at 206; \"Today Report\" at 214; 171-wide calorie and training tiles at y=242 ending at 360; a 350x124 cycling map at 368 ending at 492; heart and steps tiles resized to 104 at y=500 ending at 604; the \"Keep it Up! 💪\" banner 40 tall at 612 ending at 652; water and sleep tiles 104 tall at 660 ending at 764; tab bar at 766.\n\nSo I issue two build calls now, then wire prototype links after all five frames exist.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":9343,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":97964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9343}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"ae0a58ad-f4e4-4a76-a16f-21b8117d47fe","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:23:05.536Z","thinking_duration_ms":84208}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOgVB5hjtaMod1uSzdgc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01cg3U2BB1TLyz8zJIeU8Wpo","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"for(const s of ['Regular','Bold','Black','Medium','SemiBold']){ await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Lato',style:s}); }\nconst page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf('03')===0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst H=h=>{h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};};\nconst C={lime:'#BBF246',char:'#192126',ink2:'#5B6B72',muted:'#8B979D',line:'#E9EDEF',track:'#E6EAEC',white:'#FFFFFF',bg:'#F5F7F8',dark:'#1F2B31'};\nconst F={R:{family:'Lato',style:'Regular'},B:{family:'Lato',style:'Bold'},K:{family:'Lato',style:'Black'}};\nconst TS=await figma.getLocalTextStylesAsync();\nconst S=n=>TS.find(x=>x.name===n);\nconst IMG={onboard:'44ddcf352d6de351b71d06a506e967fe6d03c13c',lower:'1303318356825b2c1d3108b2b8bb53adc6a4c9b7',hand:'c690d5156c51db879ce334cbfa70c2729042956b',\n push:'e4d40d4f54597e68ae7ffc61bb102f7cdc5e97ea',sit:'fac887b624f0a807598229986e617c2de4803452',knee:'fb77c66132917b854367423c52c22b13df39e2fd',\n belly:'729ae8502ec31636250dc567ab7b3f1c9738d8c4',losefat:'fe26967f3de7b5e4b130e59faef747e9452b2a1f',plank:'e253947388338f0b0fd63a08ec9df0eba9c11eee',\n biceps:'6c0a3f8f56d60130bcace853c8d14de9ea8000ad',leg:'1513f5d7086ed9d38c1db245cf1cfa3441ddb093',backlunge:'f3c2b3c833d85a979d84e29240d775aaf3340834',\n quarantine:'7539acdeb30312c7bde52bd81df9d75417521c4f'};\nconst ICON={chev:'5:19',heart:'5:24',play:'5:26',sleep:'5:29',steps:'5:30',water:'5:32',timer:'5:31',fire:'5:20'};\n\nfunction txt(str,style,color,opt){ const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName=F.R; const st=S(style); if(st) t.textStyleId=st.id;\n  t.characters=str; if(opt&&opt.size) t.fontSize=opt.size; if(opt&&opt.bold) t.fontName=F.B; if(opt&&opt.black) t.fontName=F.K;\n  if(opt&&opt.ls) t.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS',value:opt.ls};\n  t.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:H(color)}]; if(opt&&opt.w){ t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(opt.w,t.height); }\n  if(opt&&opt.align) t.textAlignHorizontal=opt.align;\n  return t; }\nfunction rect(name,w,h,fill,rad){ const r=figma.createRectangle(); r.name=name; r.resize(w,h); r.cornerRadius=rad||0;\n  r.fills=fill?[{type:'SOLID',color:H(fill)}]:[]; return r; }\nfunction photo(hash,w,h,rad){ const r=figma.createRectangle(); r.name='Photo'; r.resize(w,h); if(rad) r.cornerRadius=rad;\n  r.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',scaleMode:'FILL',imageHash:hash}]; return r; }\nfunction icon(id,color,size){ const i=figma.getNodeById(id).createInstance(); i.resize(size,size);\n  i.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>{ if(v.strokes&&v.strokes.length) v.strokes=[{type:'SOLID',color:H(color)}]; }); return i; }\nfunction grad(w,h,from,to,ang){ const r=figma.createRectangle(); r.name='Scrim'; r.resize(w,h);\n  r.fills=[{type:'GRADIENT_LINEAR',gradientTransform:ang||[[1,0,0],[0,1,0]],gradientStops:[\n    {position:0,color:{r:from.r,g:from.g,b:from.b,a:from.a}},{position:1,color:{r:to.r,g:to.g,b:to.b,a:to.a}}]}]; return r; }\nconst dk=(a)=>({r:0.098,g:0.129,b:0.149,a:a});\nfunction setText(inst,nm,val){ const n=inst.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'&&x.name===nm); if(n){ n.characters=val; } return n; }\nconst sets={};\nfunction needSet(name){ if(sets[name]) return sets[name]; const s=page.findOne(n=>(n.type==='COMPONENT_SET'&&n.name===name)||(n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name===name)); sets[name]=s; return s; }\nfunction variant(setName,match){ const s=needSet(setName); if(!s) throw new Error('missing '+setName);\n  if(s.type==='COMPONENT') return s;\n  const c=s.children.find(x=>x.name.indexOf(match)>=0); if(!c) throw new Error('missing variant '+setName+' '+match); return c; }\nconst statusBar=figma.getNodeById('1:38'), homeInd=figma.getNodeById('1:49');\nfunction chrome(frame,dark){\n  const sb=statusBar.createInstance(); frame.append