{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOhwvLlqsDWzxSD88ejt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to review the prototype and screenshots, list the remaining fixes, and request the edit. The 9-link prototype runs with no failures. My checks find these defects: 04's \"Let's Workout\" pill collapses to its content because primaryAxisSizingMode defaults to AUTO, so I set it to FIXED with a 350x56 resize; the same holds for 01's CTA. On 03, \"Build Wider Bic\" truncates at width 168 and the level tag at x=171-width, y=101 overlaps the name, so I move the tag to y=134, set the tile to 158 tall, rows at 228 and 388, Challenge header at 552 with cards at 584, and Fast Warmup header at 664 with cards at 694. On 05, the Cycling title moves to y=48 and sub to y=72, and Keep It Up gets fixed sizing. On 02, the \"Popular Workouts\" and \"3 of 5 done\" labels sit tight, so I drop the right-side labels. The edit is one atomic call; re-screenshot 01, 03, 04, 05 after.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5957,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":195035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5957}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"0d45a4a6-e7cb-43ea-99df-05b5377b4e84","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:40:18.876Z","thinking_duration_ms":22454}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOhwvLlqsDWzxSD88ejt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Screens and prototype links are working. The screenshots show four concrete defects to fix: the Workout CTA collapsed to its text width instead of the full pill, the Explore program tiles truncate names and their level tags sit on top of the name, the Explore section headers crowd the cards below, and two Analytics overlays overlap their own labels. All of those are edits inside the same file, so I can do them in one call; re-screenshotting has to wait for that result."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5957,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":195035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5957}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"f53a3f45-16bc-40ed-8f36-6e493d348840","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:40:21.599Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOhwvLlqsDWzxSD88ejt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013KJt2hB4eVrY6XFGqbj2ou","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"for(const s of ['Regular','Bold','Black','Medium','SemiBold']){ await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Lato',style:s}); }\nconst page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf('03')===0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst H=h=>{h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};};\nconst C={char:'#192126',ink2:'#5B6B72',muted:'#8B979D',lime:'#BBF246',white:'#FFFFFF'};\nconst F={B:{family:'Lato',style:'Bold'},K:{family:'Lato',style:'Black'},R:{family:'Lato',style:'Regular'}};\nconst fixes=[];\nfunction fixFixed(n,w,h){ if(!n) return; try{ n.layoutMode=n.layoutMode; n.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; n.counterAxisSizingMode='FIXED'; n.resize(w,h);}catch(e){} }\n\n// ---- 01 CTA ----\nconst f1=figma.getNodeById('22:886');\nconst cta1=f1&&f1.findOne(n=>n.name==='CTA / Get Started');\nif(cta1) fixFixed(cta1,350,56);\n\n// ---- 04 CTA ----\nconst f4=figma.getNodeById('22:1138');\nconst cta4=f4&&f4.findOne(n=>n.name==='CTA / Lets Workout');\nif(cta4) fixFixed(cta4,350,56);\n\n// ---- 05 Keep It Up ----\nconst f5=figma.getNodeById('22:1217');\nconst kiu=f5&&f5.findOne(n=>n.name==='Keep It Up');\nif(kiu) fixFixed(kiu,350,44);\n\n// ---- masters: program tiles ----\nconst sm=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='05 Components · Screens');\nconst progNames=['Belly fat burner','Lose Fat','Plank','Build Wider Biceps'];\nprogNames.forEach(nm=>{\n  const m=sm&&sm.children.find(c=>c.name==='Program / '+nm);\n  if(!m) return;\n  m.resize(171,158);\n  const ph=m.findOne(x=>x.name==='Photo'); if(ph) ph.resize(171,92);\n  const t=m.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'&&x.name==='Name'); if(t){ t.fontSize=13; try{t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(171,t.height);}catch(e){} t.y=98; }\n  const mm=m.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'&&x.name==='Meta'); if(mm){ mm.y=118; }\n  const lv=m.findOne(x=>x.type==='INSTANCE'&&/^Level=/.test(x.name)); if(lv){ lv.x=0; lv.y=134; }\n});\n\n// ---- 03 screen: restack ----\nconst f3=figma.getNodeById('22:1035');\nif(f3){\n  const prog=f3.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Program / ')===0);\n  const order=['Belly fat burner','Lose Fat','Plank','Build Wider Biceps'];\n  prog.forEach(p=>{\n    const idx=order.findIndex(o=>p.name==='Program / '+o);\n    if(idx===0){ p.x=20; p.y=226; }\n    if(idx===1){ p.x=199; p.y=226; }\n    if(idx===2){ p.x=20; p.y=388; }\n    if(idx===3){ p.x=199; p.y=388; }\n  });\n  const secs=f3.findAll(n=>n.name==='Sec').filter(n=>n.parent===f3);\n  // secs order: Best for you, Challenge, Fast Warmup\n  if(secs[0]) secs[0].y=192;\n  if(secs[1]) secs[1].y=552;\n  if(secs[2]) secs[2].y=662;\n  const chs=f3.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Challenge / ')===0).filter(n=>n.parent===f3);\n  chs.forEach((c,i)=>{ c.y=584; c.x=20+i*119; });\n  const ws=f3.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Warmup / ')===0).filter(n=>n.parent===f3);\n  ws.forEach((w,i)=>{ w.y=694; w.x=20+i*179; });\n}\n// ---- challenge master text fit ----\n['Plank Challenge','Sprint Challenge','Squat Challenge'].forEach(nm=>{\n  const m=sm&&sm.children.find(c=>c.name==='Challenge / '+nm);\n  if(!m) return;\n  const t=m.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'); if(t){ t.fontSize=11; try{t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(90,t.height);}catch(e){} t.x=11; t.y=12; }\n  const a=m.findOne(x=>n=>n); const arrow=m.findAll(x=>x.type==='INSTANCE')[0]; if(arrow){ arrow.y=44; arrow.x=11; }\n});\n\n// ---- cycling tile text ----\nconst cyc=sm&&sm.children.find(c=>c.name==='TileCycling');\nif(cyc){\n  const t=cyc.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'&&x.name==='Title'); if(t) t.y=48;\n  const s=cyc.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'&&x.name==='Sub'); if(s) s.y=72;\n  const a=cyc.findAll(x=>x.type==='INSTANCE').slice(-1)[0]; if(a) a.y=44;\n}\n// ---- water tile value align ----\nconst wt=sm&&sm.children.find(c=>c.name==='TileWater');\nif(wt){ const u=wt.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'&&x.characters==='/8 Cups'); const v=wt.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'&&x.characters==='6'); if(u&&v) u.x=v.x+v.width+3; }\n\n// ---- home header collisions: drop right-side labels ----\nconst f2=figma.getNodeById('22:913');\nif(f2){\n  const secs=f2.findAll(n=>n.name==='Sec').filter(n=>n.parent===f2);\n  secs.forEach(s=>{\n    const kids=s.children.filter(c=>c.type==='TEXT');\n    if(kids.length>1){ const extra=kids.filter(k=>k.characters==='See all'||k.characters==='3 of 5 done'); extra.forEach(e=>e.remove()); }\n  });\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify({fixed:{cta1:!!cta1,cta4:!!cta4,kiu:!!kiu},f3secs:f3?f3.findAll(n=>n.name==='Sec').length:0});","description":"Fix CTA sizing, program tiles, section spacing and overlays","fileKey":"lw3cHqfMrLpMetc4EoVYw6"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":5957,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":195035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5957}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"0b790c18-5ca8-4eeb-bd8b-ee944f54991b","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:40:34.106Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013KJt2hB4eVrY6XFGqbj2ou","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
