{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOiSQ6Vjz8HThqFI3Igf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list of what I need next:\n\n1. **A fresh render of 03_Explore** — the tile master was just changed to 12px names with truncation disabled, so I need visual confirmation that \"Build Wider Biceps\" now displays whole and the Warmup cards clear the tab bar.\n2. **A structural pass over the file** — confirm the five screens still exist with correct names and sizes, that the tab bars carry a real active state, and that the nine prototype links plus the flow starting point are intact.\n3. **Final delivery summary** — file URL, workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype inventory, limitations.\n\nItem 1 and item 2 read different things and neither changes the file, so both go out now; item 3 is written text once their results are in."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3469,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":250352,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3469}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bc69212-fb2d-4921-bfba-80c85ccd3cdb","uuid":"11ec7e47-e7c5-4d39-91ae-9258a28dee12","timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:46:27.239Z"}
