{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01wvb2pRR6CTWRD4YOZ72NTl","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"1:3\" name=\"02 · Components 组件库\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"1:24\" name=\"Components\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"610\">\n    <text id=\"1:25\" name=\"Components · Fitness App (default states only)\" x=\"56\" y=\"48\" width=\"738\" height=\"39\" />\n    <text id=\"1:26\" name=\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, current tab, current day, playing, disabled…), the headers, the tab bar and every business component (workout cards, plan rows with progress, level tags, stat chips, round rows, day strip, analytics tiles, charts…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\" x=\"56\" y=\"107\" width=\"1288\" height=\"57\" />\n    <text id=\"1:27\" name=\"Button · default\" x=\"56\" y=\"184\" width=\"134\" height=\"22\" />\n    <symbol id=\"1:28\" name=\"Button\" x=\"56\" y=\"226\" width=\"350\" height=\"56\" />\n    <text id=\"1:30\" name=\"Text Field · default\" x=\"56\" y=\"302\" width=\"160\" height=\"22\" />\n    <symbol id=\"1:31\" name=\"Text Field\" x=\"56\" y=\"344\" width=\"350\" height=\"73\" />\n    <text id=\"1:35\" name=\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\" x=\"56\" y=\"437\" width=\"358\" height=\"22\" />\n    <text id=\"1:36\" name=\"iOS status bar (with notch) and home indicator, 390 wide, transparent background. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design (recolor the glyphs to white on dark areas).\" x=\"56\" y=\"479\" width=\"1288\" height=\"16\" />\n    <frame id=\"1:37\" name=\"Shell\" x=\"56\" y=\"515\" width=\"828\" height=\"47\">\n      <symbol id=\"1:38\" name=\"Status Bar\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"390\" height=\"47\" />\n      <symbol id=\"1:49\" name=\"Home Indicator\" x=\"438\" y=\"0\" width=\"390\